// Millpond: a meadow by the mill, with the beacon on a jetty above the water. A channel cuts the
// far lane, crossed only by a footbridge the winch on the near bank lowers and raises; the
// pond's two arms flank the jetty, so the way onto it is from the near side or round the ends.
// On the fifth and tenth turns the pond rises over the jetty's two sides, leaving the yard a
// single line until the turn after; a sluice on each bank lets it in early. A twig thrown in the
// water floats there for a turn as a raft.
id: millpond
name: Millpond
swing_ticks: 1
cooldown_turns: 1
water: yes
event: close
event_name: pond
event_tiles: 3,3 5,3
event_first: 5
event_every: 5
switch_rest: 2
